QR-only engine derived from rxing 0.9.3 (Apache License 2.0), a Rust port of ZXing.
Original copyright notices in each retained source file remain authoritative.
The published upstream archive contains no NOTICE file.

This derived implementation is maintained as a private component of qrcode-decode.
It narrows the entrypoints to bounded Normal (Model 2), Micro and raw Structured
Append decoding, removes unrelated formats, client/text conversion, time and
platform capabilities, and adapts namespace/module wiring. Local source changes
include early finder and spatial-bin limits, checked geometry, FNC1 compaction,
raw payload ownership transfer and removal of unused public/general interfaces.
See ORIGIN.md and source-provenance.json for exact source identity and changes.

